   391 				; Text_Window_Frame - draw a simple ASCII box ('+' '-' '|') with a blank
   392 				; interior over Txt_Row / Txt_Col / Reg1 (width-1) / Reg2 (height-1), using the
   393 				; current pen.  Uses Txt_Line as scratch.  Clobbers A/X/Y, Reg1..Reg8.
   394 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
